<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, grant me a growth</l><l>In Your life, nothing hind’ring.</l><l>Don’t let any obstacles</l><l>In me remain.</l><l>Receiving Your cross</l><l>With its breaking and killing,</l><l>Produce the good earth;</l><l>In my heart have Your way.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I’m often distracted</l><l>From Christ as the life-way;</l><l>Though zealous and active,</l><l>Imprisoned He stays.</l><l>Ignoring His “No,”</l><l>I rebel, take my own way.</l><l>Subdue me to care for</l><l>Each word that You say.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, make me someone</l><l>Who is fit for Your building.</l><l>By dealing severely,</l><l>No hind’rance remain.</l><l>Your life grow within me</l><l>Till fully maturing,</l><l>Your Bride shines in glory</l><l>For Your wedding day.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
